  "id": "gender-stereotype",
  "term": "gender stereotype",
  "definition": "A gender stereotype is an expectation that certain traits, roles, or descriptions fit males or females in a socially typical way. Information that matches these expectations is seen as more fitting, while information that goes against them can seem less natural or likely.",
